# Optional local overrides for `pnpm dev:worker` (wrangler dev). Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored).
# spec2skill needs no secrets and no API keys: the built-in samples, URL fetching and the skill
# generator all work without anything in this file.

# Workers AI model used by /api/ai/describe when the AI binding is present (default in wrangler.jsonc).
# Local dev (`--env local`) has no AI binding, so this only matters with `wrangler dev --remote`.
# AI_MODEL=@cf/meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct-fp8
